  "subtitles": [
    {
      "step": "intro",
      "chapter": "create",
      "text": "安装好后，打开界令工作台。这是真实操作，等待部分已经省略。",
      "wav": "audio/workbench-v04-01-intro.wav",
      "wav_sha256": "039b2a417f531c79ea77598b38f108667bb9be865c3ca3947b79c4b02171fb68",
      "start_seconds": 0.3,
      "end_seconds": 8.634500000000001
    },
    {
      "step": "model",
      "chapter": "create",
      "text": "先起个工作名称，再填好模型地址、名称和密钥。这里使用本地千问，密钥留空。",
      "wav": "audio/workbench-v04-02-model.wav",
      "wav_sha256": "97104f89ebe34ff5abb498a72b7cbf9468502b0d2c28643a9c2fea4acfcf5784",
      "start_seconds": 9.0,
      "end_seconds": 19.0595
    },
    {
      "step": "documents",
      "chapter": "create",
      "text": "再选中要交给它的文本资料。这里导入一份活动报价，资料名称会显示在旁边。",
      "wav": "audio/workbench-v04-03-documents.wav",
      "wav_sha256": "42c1c15d019ea5419539da240fadf92b28868eb8caaed1716267e16bd2fd2281",
      "start_seconds": 19.6,
      "end_seconds": 28.9795
    },
    {
      "step": "start",
      "chapter": "create",
      "text": "创建完成后，点击启动工作。等聊天入口出现，就能进入原生聊天界面。",
      "wav": "audio/workbench-v04-04-start.wav",
      "wav_sha256": "ba9f8544e00d9151847102fade3558e0f6ce34de1deac459e1240322fea4de3d",
      "start_seconds": 31.0,
      "end_seconds": 40.0295
    },
    {
      "step": "chat",
      "chapter": "chat",
      "text": "在聊天里请它读取报价，列出三个费用项目，并算出总费用。这次使用的是真实本地模型。",
      "wav": "audio/workbench-v04-05-chat.wav",
      "wav_sha256": "fe406d915af2e3288844ff07adbcb388bf9d79cc461c5c5fb76170c42955f4c6",
      "start_seconds": 42.3,
      "end_seconds": 53.1095
    },
    {
      "step": "answer",
      "chapter": "chat",
      "text": "模型实际读了资料，把六千、两千八和一千二相加，得到一万元。",
      "wav": "audio/workbench-v04-06-answer.wav",
      "wav_sha256": "83cc1eb040329c737d83adc6338169d1f5ca58e76d5c42aa86f1728ec8618e1c",
      "start_seconds": 54.5,
      "end_seconds": 62.2745
    },
    {
      "step": "pause",
      "chapter": "continue",
      "text": "暂时不用时，点击暂时关闭。以后再启动，还能继续原来的聊天。",
      "wav": "audio/workbench-v04-07-pause.wav",
      "wav_sha256": "434a983e9ba65b0de2e2b7d3db48d0deafb56b8208a3e0af879e11a05437406a",
      "start_seconds": 65.4,
      "end_seconds": 73.5745
    },
    {
      "step": "revoke",
      "chapter": "revoke",
      "text": "不想让它再读资料，就点收回权限，再次确认。这次收回是永久的，本版不能恢复。",
      "wav": "audio/workbench-v04-08-revoke.wav",
      "wav_sha256": "d12dee7b786e78fa75c4dc7ed351a7b1f5c146461f8d491df0ee6b703c43b2be",
      "start_seconds": 85.5,
      "end_seconds": 95.7645
    },
    {
      "step": "denied",
      "chapter": "revoke",
      "text": "再让它读取，工具就拒绝了。已经看过的内容不会被抹掉，运行中的工作还要另外关闭。",
      "wav": "audio/workbench-v04-09-denied.wav",
      "wav_sha256": "cec4da38ea173f6951e879ef6355624048d0911f22f2622b3051562886f347d3",
      "start_seconds": 105.0,
      "end_seconds": 115.1945
    }
  ]
}
